    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can call on even more powerful divine intervention. When you use your Divine Intervention feature, you can choose <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplWish000000]{Wish}</em> when you select a spell. If you do so, you can't use Divine Intervention again until you finish [[/r 2d4]] Long Rests.</p><section id=\"secret-LP9WqNdaJevppYeM\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature will consume a use of your Divine Intervention but it can not automatically recharge the usage after the rolled number of Long Rests.</p></section>",
